{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 的话句虽然更容易扫读，但部分压缩削弱了人物行为背后的具体原因，例如 S01 怕自己的需要让对方感到负担、S05 从能够假装不在乎到突然不知道如何相处，这些在 X 中解释得更充分。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边扫的普通观众，Y 的短话句、加亮重点和大小层级让我能迅速抓住每段发生了什么，再通过具体感受补足音乐带来的身体体验，而且按时出现的感受让阅读和音乐有了更明确的对应。Y 反复使用水面、小船、摇荡和歌声等意象，也让前后变化更容易被感知，情绪细节比 X 右侧孤立的短词更容易进入。不过，X 在解释人物为什么犹豫、为什么害怕、为什么改变方面更完整，Y 有些地方把心理因果压缩成了结论。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ffc33575-c59b-43f5-8846-40ee8c21259f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T052157164016Z", "elapsed_seconds": 23.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T05:22:20.418885+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5832a18448970bef9d1ec8fc24fee5d71212ff691101dce0056c12fcc8ce2694", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995